 "text": "Home - Washington County Missouri Recorder of Deeds\nSkip to content\nHOME\nMARRIAGE LICENSES\nLAND RECORDS\nELECTRONIC RECORDING\nMILITARY\nPROPERTY FRAUD ALERT\nOTHER DOCUMENTS\nHOME\nMARRIAGE LICENSES\nLAND RECORDS\nELECTRONIC RECORDING\nMILITARY\nPROPERTY FRAUD ALERT\nOTHER DOCUMENTS\nWASHINGTON COUNTY, MISSOURI\nHome Conrad Hake 2026-08-28T01:26:48-05:00\nRecorder of Deeds\nNotice to title searchers/genealogists\nIf you need any lengthy amount of time to search our vault (old records), appointments are necessary.\nYou can schedule an appointment here.\nThe Office of the Recorder of Deeds maintains public records and documents, including those pertaining to land ownership, federal and state tax liens, marriages, and military discharges.\nSign up for Property Fraud Alert!\nService Cutoff Times:\nMarriage Licenses – 4:00 p.m. *\n* We accept cash and debit cards for marriage licenses. Checks are not accepted.\nDocuments brought in after 3:30 will be processed the next business day.\nElectronic recordings are available up to 4:00 p.m.\nWe do not have any blank forms nor can we prepare a document for you. You may either prepare it yourself or contact a real estate attorney to prepare it on your behalf. If you choose to prepare it yourself you will need a standardized form (Quit Claim Deed, Warranty Deed, Beneficiary Deed, or any type of Affidavit, etc.) that meets Missouri formatting requirements. You should be able to get Missouri standardized forms on the internet, or at a local office supply retailer.\nMarriage License\nGet Info\nLand Records\nGet Info\nElectronic Recording\nGet Info\nMilitary\nGet Info\nProperty Fraud Alert\nGet Info\nOther Documents\nGet Info\nReal Estate\n$ 26 00 Frist Page\n$3.00 For each additional page\nSurveys*\n$ 26 00 First Page\n$5.00 For each additional page\nCopies $5.00 per page\nPlats*\n$ 46 00 First Page\n$25.00 For each additional page\nCopies $5.00 per page\nMarriage Licenses\n$ 63 00\nIncludes Certified Copy\n*Pages defined as 18in x 24in\nMarriage License Certification Card\n$ 2 00\nState Tax Lien\n$ 3 00\nState Tax Lien Discharges\n$ 1 50\nFederal Tax Lien\n$ 9 00\nFederal Tax Lien Release\n$ 7 50\nEmail (Deeds)\n$ 4 00\nCertification\n$ 1 00\nCopywork\n$ 2 00 First Page\n$1.00 Per Page Thereafter\nFaxes\n$ 2 00\nPDF Download\nObserved Holidays:\nNew Years Day\nMartin Luther King Junior Day\nLincoln’s Birthday\nWashington’s Birthday\nTruman’s Birthday\nMemorial Day\nJuneteeth\nIndependence Day\nLabor Day\nColumbus Day\nVeteran’s Day\nThanksgiving Day\nDay after Thanksgiving\nChristmas Eve\nChristmas Day\nTEAM DIRECTORY\nGIS MAPPING\nJAMIE MINER\nRecorder of Deeds\n102 N Missouri St.\nPotosi, MO 63664\n573.438.6111\nExt. 7510, 7512 or 7513\nHours:\n8:00 a.m. to 4:30 p.m.\nContact Us\nURL\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nName *\nFirst\nPhone *\nEmail *\nNote *\nSubmit\n© Copyright 2026 | Site by CS Design, LLC | Privacy Policy | Log In\nFacebook\nPage load link\nGo to Top\nNotifications",
